  "notClaimed": [
    "No agent or model was run and no paid call was made: the chain measures model-free retrieval recall on the six pinned dev tasks only (native-rg/v1 mean 0, product-mcp/v1 mean 0.178, deltaCI95 [0, 0.4]; 2 wins, 0 losses, 4 ties). The three pinned repair tasks are pure-symptom reports, so the identifier planner (anchor-identifier/v2: anchors and backtick spans only) plans nothing for them (emptyPlanSlots 3 per driver); they are COMPLETE with recall 0, count as ties and halve both means. native-rg/v1 is a weak single-shot baseline. No holdout result was produced or read",
    "evaluate-java-task binds --dataset identity (split-bound tasks and gold) and freezes the schedule, but a live agent run on MAC-10 rows is not wired (the live path reads kit fields: query/corpus/required_evidence and the kit repair adapter); such attempts fail closed (BLOCKED_SETUP). Wiring it, and keeping task IDs (which name their subjects) out of agent prompts, is MAC-15 work. The evaluator slot id ignores variant (only primary exists)",
